/.lake

# Generated by the emitter, never committed: it is derived from the build,
# and a stale copy in git would be a trust record nobody regenerated.
attest/

# The Python half had no entries at all, so `git add contract/tests` swept
# bytecode into a commit. Caught before it was pushed; the ignore is the fix,
# not remembering to stage more carefully.
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
/contract/build/
.pytest_cache/
